<script>
const START_DATE = new Date('2026-05-29T00:00:00');
const DEADLINE   = new Date('2026-08-01T23:59:59');
const TOTAL_DAYS = 48;

const MODULES = [
  {
    id: 0, title: 'Pre-Build Artifacts',
    dayLabel: '1–2', duration: '2 days',
    desc: 'Before any code. The spec is explicit: write the three archetype JSON templates and six system prompts first, test them manually, find the holes. These artifacts are the ground truth the entire system runs on.',
    days: [
      {
        id: 'd0_0', num: 'Days 1–2', title: 'Archetype Templates + System Prompts',
        note: 'No backend code until both artifacts are complete. This is a hard constraint from the spec. A partial template set means partial system behavior, which makes debugging impossible.',
        concepts: [
          'What a hardcoded JSON template is — why it beats dynamic LLM curriculum (no hallucination, no drift)',
          'The three archetype structure — AI-Powered App (your archetype), REST API Backend, Full-Stack Web App',
          'Template anatomy: `phase_title`, `core_concept`, `ai_appropriate_tasks`, `human_required_tasks`, `explanation_gate_targets` (3–5 per phase), `gate_depth`, `unlock_condition`, `functional_unlock`',
          'Why the LLM personalizes language but never touches phase order or gate targets',
          'The six system prompts you must draft: roadmap generation, phase explanation, gate Turn 1, gate Turn 2, gate Turn 3, gate evaluation',
          'How to test system prompts manually in Claude/ChatGPT before writing a line of backend code',
          'Adversarial test cases to run: student skipping the anchor statement, student giving a textbook Turn 3 answer, project that doesn\'t fit the archetype cleanly',
          'Environment setup alongside this: `pyenv` or system Python, `venv`, `pip`, `.env` files via `python-dotenv`, `.gitignore` structure',
          'Terminal fluency: `cd`, `ls`, `mkdir`, `touch`, `cat`, `grep`, `pwd` — used every day',
          'Git basics — init, add, commit, push, branches. GitHub repo created for this project from day one.',
        ],
